# LaTeX build artifacts
build/
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.brf
*.spl
# Generated deliverables at the paper/ root are build products; Elsevier wants
# editable source (.tex). Any compiled PDF or generated DOCX at this level is
# regenerated from its .tex source, so never track it. The leading slash anchors
# these rules to paper/ ONLY, so tracked assets in subfolders are unaffected:
#   - paper/figs/*.pdf          (vendored vector figures, required by the build)
#   - paper/declarations/*.docx (required submission declaration files)
/*.pdf
/*.docx
